From: helmfile-enhancement-plan
Subject: [PATCH] PR-T-11 — Delete dte/distributed-worker.test (76 MB binary) + .gitignore

Closes G11 (76 MB compiled test binary checked into git).
Branch: chore/remove-stale-test-binary

NOTE: this patch CANNOT express the binary deletion in unified-diff
form. The executor must run the two `git rm` / `git mv` commands shown
below FIRST, then apply the .gitignore append diff.

---
Manual step (cannot be expressed as a text diff):

    cd /Users/tchen7/MyProjects/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile
    git rm --cached dte/distributed-worker.test
    git commit -m "Remove 76 MB stale test binary (PR-T-11)"

Then apply the diff below (extends .gitignore).

---
 atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/.gitignore | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/.gitignore b/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/.gitignore
--- a/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/.gitignore
+++ b/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/.gitignore
@@ -1,4 +1,15 @@
 # existing ignores...
 *.log
 .DS_Store

+# PR-T-11: never commit Go test binaries
+*.test
+**/distributed-worker
+**/distributed-client
+**/bin/
+
+# coverage artifacts
+coverage.out
+coverage.html
+
+# pytest / pre-commit
+.pytest_cache/
+.pre-commit-cache/
